{"name": "Rogue Rollers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/00157a3858fcedb48b34ede891724a59.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/00157a3858fcedb48b34ede891724a59.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Rollers\u00a0</strong>is a high-speed roguelike where pinball physics meets dungeon-crawling chaos. Smash through deadly chambers, collect powerful relics, and summon legendary allies as you fight your way past bizarre monsters and colossal bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/48d5822e6a1deac2df6f7cf74db70116.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/303c00438e2cee3846b9c0ce126320b3.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/303c00438e2cee3846b9c0ce126320b3.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slam into enemies, trigger bumpers, and chain kinetic combos in tight, handcrafted pinball arenas with roguelike progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/d6eb302c18994f12b37983aba2c56f6a.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/14f6085e41cc20cab3f690c5c7df4799.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Rogue</strong> \u2013 fast, evasive, and deadly with critical strikes    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Mage</strong> \u2013 manipulative, ranged, and master of arcane summons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Knight</strong> \u2013 durable, powerful, and built for direct impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022\u00a0<strong>More planned</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/140e2c86810ccd9da181e79dfd837339.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/f77bdbf749f7f3f97fe90dbce5284245.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/f77bdbf749f7f3f97fe90dbce5284245.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/f77bdbf749f7f3f97fe90dbce5284245.mp4?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and equip mystical weapons that alter how your ball behaves\u2014from explosive rebounds to chain lightning trails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/448301d32eab72d2f61bd417d53b0204.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/ecce933098c3becd8cf04c805acbdf3e.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/ecce933098c3becd8cf04c805acbdf3e.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 stackable relics that can enhance, corrupt, or completely transform your playstyle. Synergies are key\u2014experiment or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/994fbd8885c267f8846c965b426543df.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/cf20e6afe1ac18246ba1ee711ada1b71.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/cf20e6afe1ac18246ba1ee711ada1b71.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the forgebound blacksmith between runs to upgrade your arsenal, re-roll your relics, or enhance upcoming pinball chambers with new hazards, rewards, or branching effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/e3f3d74fa370bae22a424dce8fce7c72.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/f551cab81b0f66a99c10a384e98161ae.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/f551cab81b0f66a99c10a384e98161ae.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face down larger-than-life bosses in multi-stage fights. Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and slam them into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/a29200865d887c047ad62fc08f4fcfdd.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/523ac01c367b3c001602a3fd40ab2734.poster.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/523ac01c367b3c001602a3fd40ab2734.webm?t=1779476967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and summon spirits, creatures, and machines mid-run. Each one has unique abilities\u2014from shielding your path to unleashing devastating multi-hit attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/081a9e1d1f1e4776d18979bb4bf12c77.avif?t=1779476967\" width=\"624\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a branching world map full of risks, rewards, mystery shops, cursed trials, elite enemies, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a pinball wizard or a roguelike enthusiast, <strong>Rogue Rollers</strong>\u00a0is your ticket to fast-paced arcade carnage with deep progression and devilish charm.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A pinball roguelike where you battle through chaotic arenas and cursed dungeons, unlock powerful upgrades, and choose branching paths as you bounce, bash, and roll your way through an ever-changing world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/e38008c05fa26f264483c10f6acabb66b1fa6235/header.jpg?t=1779476967", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Pinball", "Action Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Roguelike", "Procedural Generation", "Dungeon Crawler"], "developers": "Isopod Games", "publishers": "Isopod Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3715690", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "11 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/CH-iurIEENQ", "first_seen": 1773183600.0, "review_rank": 1019}